OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 2 Oct to Sun 11 Oct
OL,6,FInitially, some outbreaks of rain may
OL,7,Faffect the UK, especially the north
OL,8,Fand west. These changeable conditions
OL,9,Fwill probably give way to higher
OL,10,Fpressure and a more settled period of
OL,11,Fweather through the early part of the
OL,12,Fperiod. The speed at which high
OL,13,Fpressure builds, and whether it will
OL,14,Fbe focussed across the north or south,
OL,15,Fremains finely balanced. This will
OL,16,Flead to a drier than average period
OL,17,Foverall, with lighter winds than
OL,18,Faverage. Some interludes of more
OL,19,Funsettled weather and stronger winds
OL,20,Fare likely at times, but there are
OL,21,Fmixed signals as to where these are
OL,22,Fmore probable. Temperatures are likely
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fto remain warmer than average.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
