CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1790516879
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 12 Oct to Mon 26 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure and more settled
OL,7,Fconditions early in the period may
OL,8,Fgive way to a more changeable pattern
OL,9,Ftowards mid-October. This will bring a
OL,10,Fgreater chance of wet and windy
OL,11,Fconditions at times, but there will
OL,12,Fstill be periods of drier and more
OL,13,Fsettled weather. Temperatures are
OL,14,Flikely be above average for the period
OL,15,Fas a whole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
